        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); padding:14px 0;">
            <h3 style="font-size:1rem; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">What cable standards and certifications do you support for MDF/IDF builds?</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.7;">We install and certify Cat6, Cat6A (UTP/STP), single-mode, and multi-mode (OM3/OM4) fiber optic cabling adhering to TIA/EIA-568 standards, providing detailed wiremap, attenuation, and continuity test results for all terminated drops.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); padding:14px 0;">
            <h3 style="font-size:1rem; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Can USS clean up and re-patch an existing, cluttered server room or IDF closet?</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.7;">Yes. We specialize in live and maintenance-window closet remediations, including tracing lines, swapping tangled patch leads for custom zero-slack cables, reorganizing patch panels, and installing proper vertical/horizontal wire management.</p>
